      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that. You were saying the glucose-6-phosphatase enzyme removes the phosphate group, which results in what exactly? And how does that free glucose actually get out of the liver cell and into the rest of the body? I'm trying to picture the whole pathway from the glycogen molecule to the bloodstream.",
